# Design System

## Theme
- Dark theme ONLY. Colors are HSL CSS variables in `src/index.css` (including the
  `--pack-<tier>-*` palettes). Don't change the variable system.
- Primary/Gold `43 96% 46%` · Background `222 30% 7%` · Accent `215 60% 50%`.

## Glass
Use `<GlassPanel>` for card-like containers. Underlying classes:
`bg-card/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-border/50 rounded-xl`.
Performance mode (`perf-mode` root class) strips `.glass-surface`; a bare
`backdrop-blur-*` utility is NOT stripped.

## Typography
- Headings `font-display` (Oswald), body DM Sans.
- Type floor is 11px: use `text-micro` (11px) for the smallest copy, not
  `text-[10px]` or smaller.

## Rating colors
```
≥80 → text-emerald-400
≥70 → text-primary (gold)
≥60 → text-amber-400
<60 → text-muted-foreground
```

## Layout
- Mobile-first, test at 375px: `max-w-lg mx-auto`, safe-area padding.
- Tap targets are at least 44px.
- Inline `style={{ backgroundColor }}` only for club colors or computed values.

## Player cards
- Card art is 2:3 (1024x1536) and its alpha is the card's edge: `md`/`lg`/`xl`
  render `aspect-[2/3]` with no rounded box. `xs`/`sm` chips keep
  `aspect-[3/4]` with a rounded box.

## Motion
- framer-motion honours reduced motion via `MotionConfig`; CSS `transition-*`
  utilities do not — gate them on `useReducedMotionPref()`.

## Don'ts
- No raw hex colors outside club colors — use CSS variables or Tailwind classes.
- No `dark:` prefix — the app is always dark.
